        "manipulate"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "A ghaele attempts to Recall Knowledge about a foe they are facing. If successful, they can change the elemental damage dealt by their greatsword and light ray to acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic, usually to match the foe's weakness. They can also change their energy resistance to any of these energy types (this can be a different type than for their attacks) The choices remain until they next use Choose Weakness."
      ]
    },
    {
